- **B1: not already built.** `build_opconstwire_v0.py:1,35` is a different tool: a scan that finds the wire a constant feeds. It was never built; see `tools/bench/diag_c64_perturb_t1t3.json:1262` ("VI not on disk") and `archive/2026-09-15-status-stage2-cycles-1-7.md:392`. No `OpConstWire*` VI exists under `claudeDev`. `gscript.wire_const` (`tools/gscript.py:2047-2084`) is new, uncommitted work that belongs to this same card.
